.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-policy-rule 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-policy\-rule \- Resolve a rule id to the remedy its row declares
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten policy rule\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolve a rule id to the remedy its row declares
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIid\fR>
The rule id to resolve, e.g. no\-raw\-issue\-read
